Error [jet.EmptyTypeArgumentList]: `Box<>` has an empty type-argument list
  --> tests/ui/empty_type_argument_list.jet:5:18
    |
  5 | size: fn(box: Box<>) -> Int {
    |                  ^^
 Why: A type's arguments go between `<` and `>`; `<>` lists none, so it only adds noise
 Fix: Write the type arguments, such as `Box<Int>`, or drop the `<>`
